nd WFHW as an intentional balance point?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nah. <span style=\"color:white\">10char</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T11:16:21-07:00","id":1221769,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1221588-solar-firewand-charms?p=1221760#post1221760\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nah. <span style=\"color:white\">10char</span></div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for the prompt reply!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T14:15:53-07:00","id":1221836,"title":"","content":"There's also Evocations to take care of reloading on both the artifact flame weapons in Arms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/21733-ascension","name":"Ascension","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar21733_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T18:10:00-07:00","id":1221895,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ascension</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1221588-solar-firewand-charms?p=1221836#post1221836\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's also Evocations to take care of reloading on both the artifact flame weapons in Arms.</div> </div> </div> </div>But they don't allow flame weapons to work with multi-attack charms like Boughs of Burning Branches does.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T23:32:34-07:00","id":1221954,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MoroseMorgan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1221588-solar-firewand-charms?p=1221895#post1221895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But they don't allow flame weapons to work with multi-attack charms like Boughs of Burning Branches does.</div> </div> </div> </div>Personally, I think the Sirrush evocations in Arms of the Chosen (67) works in this manner, and allow multi-attack charms to trigger which makes sense considering it has a multiple attack charm Forked Lightning Flame Attack (68).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1635-citadel97501","name":"Citadel97501","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"544"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-25T06:49:48-07:00","id":1222016,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Citadel97501</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1221588-solar-firewand-charms?p=1221954#post1221954\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Personally, I think the Sirrush evocations in Arms of the Chosen (67) works in this manner, and allow multi-attack charms to trigger which makes sense considering it has a multiple attack charm Forked Lightning Flame Attack (68).</div> </div> </div> </div>I actually asked about this about a month ago in the dev thread, whether reflexive reload charms let you use multiple attack charms like Boughs does, or if they have to specifically say they do.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1069023-ask-the-devs?p=1206461#post1206461\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's gotta specify.</div> </div> </div> </div>I imagine in Sirrush's case, it gets a pass on its own multi attack charms because the alternative is, well, that they just plain don't work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23912-scottsman","name":"Scottsman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-25T09:30:10-07:00","id":1222058,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I\u2019m pretty sure a firewand Evocation that lets you make multiple attacks counts as specifically letting you make multiple attacks with that firewand.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-25T09:55:48-07:00","id":1222071,"title":"","content":"Yeah, that's the ruling, but I'm still mulling it over personally.<br /> <br /> At first I thought it might have been a balance thing, not putting it on artifacts because they wanted it to be something you can only get from native charms, but DBs get it from native charms, so I'm not sure whom it is to be gated from. Maybe Exigents, spirits, and misc weird stuff?<br /> <br /> The only thing I could think was maybe Sekhem having it for free would be too stronk\u00ae, but I don't see it for Sirrush. Although, Sirrush's attack is an AoE, not a multi-attack. It is one shot that affects multiple targets, not multiple shots. It's an important distinction. Same for RD AoE.<br /> <br /> Sirrush- Firedust-Gathering Practice- 1m. Reload only. 1 charm in and a resonant Free Unlock.<br /> <br /> Sekhem- Dragon's Scorching Breath- 0-4m depending, Reloads and Generates Ammo. 1 charm in and a resonant Free Unlock.<br /> <br /> DB Archer- Boughs of Burning Autumn- 2m, 1i, Reload and Multi-attack. 2nd charm in.<br /> <br /> Y'know, the more I look at it, the better I feel about the ruling. The only thing I would be curious of is if you can activate Dragon's Scorching Breath to reload without using ammo, and then use Boughs of Burning Autumn to mult-attack? I'll cross-post to Dev-thread.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-26T00:31:17-07:00","id":1222177,"title":"","content":"<b>Blazing Fusillade Discipline</b><br /> Cost: 2m; Mins: Archery 4, Essence 1<br /> Type: Reflexive<br /> Keywords: Perilous<br /> Prerequisite Charms: Trance of Unhesitating Speed<br /> <br /> Fire. Load. Fire. Load. Fire. Essence speeds the Solar's hands, allowing her to reflexively reload a firewand or flame piece. This permits her to use it in combination with Charms that make multiple attacks, such as Trance of Unhesitating Speed, as long as she pays this Charm\u2019s cost before each additional attack past the first.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1856-hakkonen","name":"Hakkonen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}